{"id": "112-1-B-064", "year": 112, "session": 1, "subject": "B", "number": 64, "stem": "下列輻射造成的染色體／染色質變異：重疊環狀（overlapping rings）、無中節（acentric）、分裂後期橋\n（anaphase bridge），及對稱互換（symmetric translocation），何者屬於致死變異，且無論在 G1、G2 期接受照\n射皆可能發生？", "options": {"A": "重疊環狀（overlapping rings）", "B": "無中節（acentric）", "C": "分裂後期橋（anaphase bridge）", "D": "對稱互換（symmetric translocation）"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/112_1/22_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
